The source is BKK's static Budapest GTFS, feed version 2826.20261031, service dates 2026-10-31
through 2026-12-01, captured 2026-10-31. It is not KCR or EHA.
OpenGeocoding joins routes, trips, stop_times and stops to select metro-served parent stations,
excludes ambiguous station names, and constructs landmark queries with city/country context.
Coordinates remain the published GTFS station coordinates. Query forms and sampling are modified
outputs; BKK does not endorse this corpus or OpenGeocoding. No house-address, platform or entrance
accuracy is asserted.
